  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><p class=\"p1\" id=\"isPasted\"><br></p><h3><strong>About Our Brand and Products</strong></h3><p><br></p><p class=\"p2\"><br></p><p class=\"p3\">Bio Renewal is a professional skincare brand dedicated to high-performance formulations backed by science and innovation. Our product line is developed for spas, aesthetic clinics, and skincare professionals, offering advanced solutions that deliver visible results — from anti-aging and brightening to acne care and barrier repair.</p><p class=\"p2\"><br></p><p class=\"p1\"><br></p><h3><strong>What Makes Us Different</strong></h3><p><br></p><p class=\"p2\"><br></p><p class=\"p3\">We combine cutting-edge biotechnology with clinically proven active ingredients to create products that deliver both immediate and long-term results. Our formulations are designed for professional use but are safe and effective for at-home care, giving clients results they can see and feel. With a strong focus on education, innovation, and results-driven treatments, Bio Renewal stands apart as a trusted partner for skincare professionals and enthusiasts.</p><p class=\"p2\"><br></p><p class=\"p1\"><br></p><h3><strong>How Affiliates Can Earn</strong></h3><p><br></p><p class=\"p2\"><br></p><p class=\"p3\">Affiliates earn <span class=\"s2\"><strong>40% commission on total referral sales</strong></span> whenever a customer makes a purchase through your unique affiliate link or uses your personalized coupon code. Payments are processed and sent <span class=\"s2\"><strong>on the 5th of each month</strong></span>.</p><p class=\"p2\"><br></p><p class=\"p1\"><br></p><h3><strong>How to Promote Us</strong></h3><p><br></p><p class=\"p2\"><br></p><p class=\"p3\">Promote Bio Renewal by sharing your affiliate link or coupon code across your social media platforms, website, email newsletters, blogs, or online communities. Highlight the product benefits, before-and-after results, or your personal experience to drive engagement and sales.</p><p class=\"p2\"><br></p><p class=\"p1\"><br></p><h3><strong>Other Information</strong></h3><p><br></p><p class=\"p2\"><br></p><p class=\"p3\">We provide marketing materials, product education, and promotional updates to help you succeed. As part of our affiliate community, you’ll be among the first to know about new product launches, special campaigns, and exclusive offers — all designed to help you maximize your earnings and grow with the Bio Renewal brand.</p></div>",
